<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Toepfer Athens barley bids.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Toepfer Athens barley bids.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday accepted tenders from Toepfer Athens for the supply of two 25,000-tonne cargoes of barley, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It accepted the first bid at $145.36 per tonne and the second at $144.36 per tonne CAF.</p>
</text>
